  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: uninitialised stack data used as the length of a\n     Proxy Protocol v2 header\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-94056.patch: repeat the read of the PROXY\n       v2 length field until the complete 16-byte header has arrived, and\n       abort if the peer closes before that, so the header length is\n       never taken from uninitialised stack memory\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-94056-2.patch: fail PROXY reads on peer EOF\n     - CVE-2026-94056",
